WEBVTT

1
00:00:17.536 --> 00:00:21.440
When the girls got back to Mateo's house, Ally pulled Mateo aside.

2
00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.782
"Can I talk to you for a second?

3
00:00:24.262 --> 00:00:25.823
I need to show you an article."

4
00:00:26.984 --> 00:00:28.426
"Sure," Mateo said.

5
00:00:28.446 --> 00:00:30.908
"But first, I have some news of my own to share."

6
00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:34.341
He went over to Bethany and Kate.

7
00:00:34.361 --> 00:00:37.563
"Remember I told you my mom was coming back to town?

8
00:00:38.623 --> 00:00:40.464
Well, she's arriving tomorrow!"

9
00:00:41.605 --> 00:00:42.766
"Great news!"

10
00:00:43.226 --> 00:00:44.206
Bethany exclaimed.

11
00:00:44.227 --> 00:00:47.748
"Does this mean your parents are getting back together?"

12
00:00:48.049 --> 00:00:48.629
Kate asked.

13
00:00:48.649 --> 00:00:50.210
"I'm not sure."

14
00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:51.430
Mateo shrugged.

15
00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:52.891
"Papi didn't say."

16
00:00:54.112 --> 00:00:59.035
"Either way, I'm glad your family will all be together in Sandville," Bethany said.

17
00:00:59.055 --> 00:01:01.136
"Me too," Mateo said.

18
00:01:02.112 --> 00:01:04.033
"Your mom is a fashion designer, right?"

19
00:01:04.434 --> 00:01:04.914
Kate said.

20
00:01:04.934 --> 00:01:07.336
"Do you think she can give me some fashion tips?"

21
00:01:08.456 --> 00:01:10.298
"For sure," Mateo said.

22
00:01:10.318 --> 00:01:13.560
"She loves talking about fashion and her new business."

23
00:01:14.461 --> 00:01:19.184
Ally was happy for Mateo, but the news of his mom's homecoming did make her a bit worried.

24
00:01:19.204 --> 00:01:22.806
"Mateo's mom is going to want her sewing room back.

25
00:01:24.367 --> 00:01:27.229
I'll have to find a new place to live," Ally thought.

26
00:01:27.249 --> 00:01:30.652
"Unless Something suddenly occurred to her.

27
00:01:31.212 --> 00:01:34.353
"Unless I can find a way home on that billionaire's P.O.D.!

28
00:01:35.294 --> 00:01:38.515
Then Mateo and I can both be reunited with our families!"

29
00:01:39.215 --> 00:01:46.558
The idea sent a shiver of excitement up Ally's spine—until Alpha suddenly started loudly playing "Reunited," a pop

30
00:01:46.578 --> 00:01:48.139
song. Ally gulped.

31
00:01:48.159 --> 00:01:50.780
"I thought I'd turned her off!"

32
00:01:51.180 --> 00:01:51.620
she thought.

33
00:01:52.181 --> 00:01:56.562
Ally was about to hit Alpha's power button when Kate playfully grabbed Alpha again.

34
00:01:56.582 --> 00:02:02.409
"If you won't tell me what apps you're using," Kate said, "I'll just have to see for myself!"

35
00:02:02.429 --> 00:02:05.030
"Danger! Stop, thief!"

36
00:02:05.510 --> 00:02:06.170
Alpha shouted.

37
00:02:06.190 --> 00:02:12.573
"Whoa! I can't believe such an old phone has such a cool security feature," Kate said.

38
00:02:13.113 --> 00:02:16.715
Ally fumbled to grab Alpha back, but Kate held the phone higher.

39
00:02:16.735 --> 00:02:20.196
"I'll give it back when you tell me what upgrades you've gotten!"

40
00:02:20.216 --> 00:02:23.397
"Please tell us, Ally," Bethany said.

41
00:02:23.417 --> 00:02:27.739
"My phone is old too, and it doesn't do any of the things yours does."

42
00:02:30.288 --> 00:02:34.489
"Er Ally didn't know what to say, but thankfully Mateo took Alpha from Kate.

43
00:02:35.229 --> 00:02:38.510
He turned Alpha off and then handed the device back to Ally.

44
00:02:38.530 --> 00:02:43.952
"Enough playing around, you guys," Mateo said.

45
00:02:43.972 --> 00:02:45.272
"I need your help.

46
00:02:45.872 --> 00:02:48.753
I want to do something nice for my mother's arrival back home.

47
00:02:49.333 --> 00:02:50.114
What should I do?"

48
00:02:50.134 --> 00:02:55.255
"You could buy her some pretty flowers," Kate said.

49
00:02:55.275 --> 00:02:58.716
"You could make her favorite meal," Bethany said.

50
00:02:59.768 --> 00:03:02.309
"Those are great ideas," Mateo said.

51
00:03:02.849 --> 00:03:03.710
Bethany smiled.

52
00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:05.231
"We're happy to help you."

53
00:03:05.731 --> 00:03:06.871
Mateo smiled back.

54
00:03:07.452 --> 00:03:09.833
"Thanks." Ray came into the room.

55
00:03:09.853 --> 00:03:12.934
"What are you going to do for your mom, Mateo?"

56
00:03:12.954 --> 00:03:17.216
"I'll probably make her favorite meal tomorrow night," Mateo said.

57
00:03:17.236 --> 00:03:18.917
"Nice idea."

58
00:03:19.457 --> 00:03:21.738
Ray smiled, but he didn't look very happy.

59
00:03:21.758 --> 00:03:24.459
"Well, right now, our dinner's ready.

60
00:03:24.879 --> 00:03:26.000
Come and get it while it's hot!"

61
00:03:28.606 --> 00:03:31.809
As everyone trooped after Ray, Ally read his thoughts.

62
00:03:32.249 --> 00:03:38.094
But he was thinking about so many things at once—his wife, the diner, and a big truck for

63
00:03:38.134 --> 00:03:38.675
some reason.

64
00:03:38.695 --> 00:03:42.598
"None of that makes any sense to me," Ally thought.

65
00:03:42.618 --> 00:03:45.881
"I guess I still don't fully understand these humans yet!"

66
00:03:48.903 --> 00:03:53.888
Later, after Kate and Bethany had gone home, Mateo sat down next to Ally on the couch.

67
00:03:54.840 --> 00:03:56.781
"What was it you wanted to show me in the newspaper?"

68
00:03:58.002 --> 00:03:58.902
Ally hesitated.

69
00:03:58.922 --> 00:04:02.704
"Mateo has enough on his mind right now," she thought.

70
00:04:02.724 --> 00:04:04.845
"I'll ask him about the P.O.D.

71
00:04:05.045 --> 00:04:07.387
after he gets to spend some time with his mom."

72
00:04:08.627 --> 00:04:09.788
"Uh, nothing."

73
00:04:10.248 --> 00:04:11.249
Ally faked a yawn.

74
00:04:11.269 --> 00:04:15.891
"I'm really tired, so I think I'll go to bed now.

75
00:04:16.392 --> 00:04:16.952
Good night!"

76
00:04:21.972 --> 00:04:25.054
In her bedroom, Ally finished reading the newspaper article.

77
00:04:25.454 --> 00:04:32.878
Could camera-shy billionaire Lainie Polk be getting ready to unveil her newest enterprise, Polk's Orbiting Device (P.O.D.)?

78
00:04:33.499 --> 00:04:37.481
Space enthusiasts everywhere are trying to figure out the ship's launch site.

79
00:04:37.821 --> 00:04:40.262
There are several other mysteries surrounding the flight.

80
00:04:40.843 --> 00:04:44.545
Will she take any passengers, and what's her final destination?

81
00:04:45.285 --> 00:04:50.712
The only things anyone knows for certain are that Lainie Polk is full of surprises and she likes

82
00:04:50.772 --> 00:04:53.053
to spend her money on interesting projects.

83
00:04:53.533 --> 00:04:58.474
The last time she held a press conference, she appeared onstage as a 3D avatar.

84
00:04:59.075 --> 00:05:02.096
We'll just have to wait to see what she's got planned now!

85
00:05:03.016 --> 00:05:04.216
Ally dropped the paper.

86
00:05:04.896 --> 00:05:09.138
If she could figure out the P.O.D.'s launch site, and if she could figure out how to get

87
00:05:09.238 --> 00:05:12.479
onboard, she just might be able to get back to space!

88
00:05:13.579 --> 00:05:16.320
But then again, that was an awful lot of ifs!
